		{
			"id":"e7fe5e8cd3746458",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**总结**\n\n1. 分子、分母去心邻域内可导\n2. 分母导数不为 $0$ \n3. 分子、分母满足三种形式（$\\dfrac 00, \\, \\dfrac {\\infty}{\\infty}, \\, \\dfrac {*}{\\infty}$）",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":13040,
			"y":4788,
			"width":540,
			"height":240
		},
